# default ignore
.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.obsidian/
chroma_db/

# MyST build outputs
_build
.vscode/
dep/

# Generated lab-ready protocol artifacts (rebuilt at deploy; never committed) — see issue #10
**/generated/

# Notion export artifacts (raw exports, zips, staging dirs)
**/resources/*.zip
**/resources/notion_export/
**/resources/Private & Shared*/
**/resources/*-notion.md

# DevNote numbered export folders (e.g. 09-cx43_cell/) — raw exports, never committed
**/resources/[0-9][0-9]-*/

# Scratch space. Staging documents live in tmp/staging/ — see tmp/README.md.
# The README is the one tracked file: the staging skill reads it to find the
# location, so it has to survive the ignore that protects everything beside it.
tmp/*
!tmp/README.md
